      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On a quiet residential street in Sapporo, college friends Akiko and Megumi chat warmly about Sister Tanaka as they walk toward Megumi's house. Halfway home, curious Megumi suddenly walks up to a group of schoolboys on the corner and asks to see what they are hiding, leaving Akiko flustered. Listen first for the breezy, clipped rhythm of two close friends talking.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "シスター田中はホント天使。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "天使だね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "そう、何でも許してくれる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "今日、恵美んち楽しみ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ホント？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "お母さんに言ってきちゃった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "何て？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "akiko",
      "t": "今日、友達んち行くからって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "何だよ、誰？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ねえ、それ私にも見せてくれない？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
